# Lab 1 - REST API with Docker

## Description
Two REST API services:
- users-service (CRUD for users)
- gateway-service (API Gateway)

## Technologies
- Python (FastAPI)
- Docker

## Run manually

### Build
docker build -t users-service:1.0 ./users-service
docker build -t gateway-service:1.0 ./gateway-service

### Network
docker network create lab1-network

### Run
docker run -d --name users-service --network lab1-network -p 8001:8000 users-service:1.0
docker run -d --name gateway-service --network lab1-network -p 8000:8000 -e USERS_SERVICE_URL=http://users-service:8000 gateway-service:1.0

## Swagger
http://localhost:8000/docs
